  "description": "Write Minecraft Dungeons II mods in C#. This MSBuild project SDK compiles C# into Unreal Blueprint bytecode and packs it as a Blueprint Loader mod: dotnet build type-checks, compiles, packs and installs the mod into the game's ~mods folder. Includes C# bindings for the whole game API (18,000+ types generated from the game), helpers for logging and timers, and editor diagnostics for unsupported C#. No Unreal Engine required.",
